    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
A single rule inside a :cpp:func:`remapKeys() &lt;BaseOrderedMultiMap::remapKeys&gt;` remap
list, expressing a *conditional* and/or *repositioned* rename (as opposed to a plain
key, which always fires and stays in place).
</verbatim></para>
